          "$2x - 3 = 4$",
          "$2x = 4 + 3$",
          "$2x = 7$",
          "$\\dfrac{2x}{2} = \\dfrac{7}{2}$",
          "إذن حدّ الحلول هو $\\dfrac{7}{2}$ ."
        ],
        "result": "k = \\dfrac{7}{2}"
